## 4. Weryfikacja po deploy

```bash
APP_PORT={{APP_PORT}}

# Liveness
curl -sf http://localhost:${APP_PORT}/api/health | jq .
# Oczekiwane: {"status":"ok","timestamp":"...","uptime":...}

# Readiness (czekaj na DB)
curl -sf http://localhost:${APP_PORT}/api/ready | jq .
# Oczekiwane: {"status":"ok","db":"connected","latency_ms":...}

# Version (weryfikacja deploy SHA)
EXPECTED_SHA=$(git rev-parse --short HEAD)
DEPLOYED_SHA=$(curl -sf http://localhost:${APP_PORT}/api/version | jq -r .sha)
[ "${DEPLOYED_SHA}" = "${EXPECTED_SHA}" ] && echo "DEPLOY VERIFIED" || echo "SHA MISMATCH"
```
